FAIL testdata/bad/run-relative.yaml:4:11  PQ1012: the command "extract" is not an absolute path

   2 | steps:
   3 |   - name: only
>  4 |     run: ["extract", "--out", "/srv/data"]
                 ^

   paceq starts the process itself. There is no shell to search PATH, and no working
   directory for a relative name to be relative to, so the first element has to say
   exactly which program to start:

       run: ["/usr/bin/extract", ...]

       command -v extract    prints the path this machine would use

   paceq error PQ1012  for the full explanation
